<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 700s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 8th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 700s BCE, 272 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 68 were founded and 28 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the State of Qin and the Kingdom of Urartu.</p></header>
